                                                "sense_id": "c60c3f20-678f-3ee2-aada-c7f0ecda7e8e",
                                                "text": "My descriptions are ontical—addressing the world we inhabit, the what and where and how and why of objects therein; my questions are not ontological in the sense of struggling (vainly) to answer the question of the being of things tout court."
                                            }
